# Docker & Kubernetes

{{#if parameters.multiStage}}
- Use multi-stage builds: builder stage with toolchain, minimal runtime image
- Pin base image digests in production Dockerfiles
{{/if}}
- Keep layers ordered for cache: deps before source, infrequent changes first
{{#if parameters.nonRootUser}}
- Create and run as a non-root user in the final image
- Set `readOnlyRootFilesystem` and drop capabilities in K8s manifests where possible
{{/if}}
- Use health checks (`HEALTHCHECK` / liveness + readiness probes)
- Never bake secrets into images; use env, secrets mounts, or external secret stores
{{#if parameters.helmCharts}}
- Helm: values.yaml for environment overrides; templates stay generic
- Document required values and provide sensible defaults in values.schema.json when applicable
{{/if}}
- Resource requests/limits on every workload; use HPA for stateless services
